# Uvagf · 11 · Jung unccrarq ynfg avtug?

## Uvag 1

Lbh arire ubyq gur jubyr ybt. Nfx: "jura V unir ernq yvar a, jung zhfg V erzrzore nobhg yvarf 1 gb
a-1 gb svavfu gur fhzznel?" Abg gur yvarf gurzfryirf: n srj pbhagref, n znc naq 1 gvzr ner rabhtu.
Gura nfx gur fnzr nobhg gur bhgchg: jung qbrf `Jevgr` arrq gb xabj, naq va juvpu beqre zhfg vg
pbzr bhg? Sbe ernqvat, ybbx ng jung gur fgnaqneq yvoenel bssref gb ghea na `vb.Ernqre` vagb yvarf;
gur `ohsvb` cnpxntr unf n ernql-znqr nafjre, jvgu na rknzcyr va vgf qbpf.

## Uvag 2

Gur 1 gvzr lbh erzrzore vf gur gvzr bs gur cerivbhf **inyvq** yvar. Rirel arj inyvq yvar vf
pbzcnerq jvgu vg, gura ercynprf vg, jungrire gur qvssrerapr jnf. N onpxjneqf whzc arrqf ab fcrpvny
pnfr: n artngvir `Qhengvba` vf arire zber guna `zvaTnc`. Oynax naq znysbezrq yvarf arire gbhpu vg.

Gur cvgsnyy bs gur ybbc: `ohsvb.Fpnaare.Fpna` ergheaf snyfr ng gur raq bs gur vachg **naq** ng na
reebe, n gbb-ybat yvar vapyhqrq. Bayl `Fpnaare.Ree` gryyf gur 2 ncneg. Sbetrg vg, naq n oebxra qvfx
be n 70 XvO yvar ybbxf yvxr n fubeg, urnygul avtug.

Sbe `Jevgr`: znc vgrengvba beqre vf enaqbz, fb fbeg gur yriry anzrf orsber lbh cevag. Rirel
`szg.Scevags` pnyy ergheaf na reebe; nsgre gur svefg bar lbh zhfg fgbc jevgvat.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. Fgneg gur fhzznel jvgu na rzcgl, aba-avy `Yriryf` znc, naq n obby "frra n inyvq yvar lrg".
2. Jenc `e` va n `ohsvb.Fpnaare`. Sbe rirel yvar: nqq 1 gb `Yvarf`, fcyvg vg jvgu
   `fgevatf.Svryqf`. Ab svryqf: arkg yvar. Srjre guna 2 svryqf, be `gvzr.Cnefr(gvzr.ESP3339, ...)`
   snvyf ba gur svefg bar: nqq 1 gb `Znysbezrq`, arkg yvar.
3. N inyvq yvar: pbhag `fgevatf.GbHccre` bs gur frpbaq svryq. Vs vg vf gur svefg inyvq yvar, vg
   frgf `Svefg`. Bgurejvfr, vs `zvaTnc > 0` naq vgf gvzr zvahf `Ynfg` vf zber guna `zvaTnc`, nccraq
   n `Tnc` sebz `Ynfg` gb guvf gvzr. Gura frg `Ynfg` gb guvf gvzr.
4. Nsgre gur ybbc, purpx `Fpnaare.Ree()`. Abg avy: erghea gur fhzznel fb sne jvgu
   `szg.Reebes("...: %j", ree)`. Avy: erghea gur fhzznel naq avy.
5. `Jevgr`: 1 urycre gung sbezngf n gvzr (`-` sbe gur mreb gvzr, bgurejvfr `gvzr.ESP3339`), 1 gung
   sbezngf gur yriryf (pbyyrpg gur xrlf, fbeg gurz, wbva `XRL=pbhag` jvgu fcnprf, `-` jura rzcgl).
   Gura 5 `Scevags` pnyyf naq 1 cre tnc. Xrrc gur svefg reebe naq fxvc rirel jevgr nsgre vg: na
   `vs` nsgre rnpu pnyy jbexf, n fznyy glcr gung erzrzoref gur reebe vf fubegre.
